    "innovation": "This paper uses an ocean general circulation model to demonstrate that the 1976-77 Pacific climate shift was caused by unique atmospheric anomalies that altered large-scale ocean currents and heat fluxes, with the new climate state maintained by persistent changes in ocean mixing and heat exchange.",
